            "text": "Taking time for introductions and a brief tour of the building helps the pre-service teacher feel part of the school and aids the important transition from college student. Include the pre-service teacher on staff mailing list and in staff workshops and social functions.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219525+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8047",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8047",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8047",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:433d269575c0d9044c1598ca2668fb04ef150b80bc7e5ea4dd87782fcc1170d0",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219531+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39",
            "text": "By dividing the space in a kitchen drawer where you keep all your cooking utensils, you grouped items by size or purpose.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219531+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8455",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8455",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8455",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:99be9dad260224db4ce9da54fcf48f599719839a628666722f9b0a824e465416",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219532+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39",
            "text": "The suffering caused by the embargo is sometimes reported here as well.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219532+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8609",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8609",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8609",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:97feb78991f273148eaad9cb4bd9d1a30f3a1bb16bf4d762cdabd7875c1c889d",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219538+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39",
            "text": "This dryer has a wall on one side, wall on the back, oil heater on the side and a water heater in front.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219538+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8771",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8771",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8771",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:0e74e874bc3088b2bfc5fc41b1eef5c8f5433150c5f2042e7a675f3f9d47e4e4",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219543+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39",
            "text": "Even the thinnest crack in a humidor is an open invitation to cigar beetles.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219543+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8821",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-8821",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8821",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:68b44c9bfb046261830dd9a68425548ecbac74e452d4e82f1f8bdafc416f04c4",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219553+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39",
            "text": "The ombudsman's report concluded that \"a large part of the package was not provided\".",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219553+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-9043",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-9043",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9043",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:54f6bc74324f07c096ca1e9cabbd62879fbbfe9f2625dd8f4f59a6ad0b7fe4fa",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219559+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39",
            "text": "The drug was in a bottle that was not prescribed to her.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219559+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-9087",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-9087",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9087",
