            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219563+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39",
            "text": "Fog caused delays at the Charlotte Douglas International Airport Monday morning.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219563+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-9423",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39-semeval-9423",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9423",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:787119e430f52f66a76634079bb2cb1527dcbd0901ebcea8a477e66e730e51b8",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219567+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b39",
            "text": "The oak tree was growing in the woods of the Longleat Estate, in Wiltshire, at the time Darwin was alive and developing his theory.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T14:04:52.219567+00:00"
          },
          {
